{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36859","headline":"寄池州郑员外 · 罗隐","name":"寄池州郑员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兽遶朱轮酒满船，郡城萧洒贵池边。\n衣同莱子曾分笔，扇似袁宏别有天。\n九点好山楼上客，两行高柳雨中烟。\n陵阳百姓将何福，社舞村歌又一年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}